<div class="rug-panel--content rug-panel--content--border">
<h1 class="rug-mb-0 rug-clearfix">Bachelor's degree programmes</h1>
</div>
<div id="target-content-holder"></div>
<div>
<article class="rug-clearfix rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p>Looking for an undergraduate programme at a top university in the Netherlands? With over 45 different Bachelor's programmes, some of which have several variants (tracks) the University of Groningen is the place to be. On this page you will find an overview of the programmes we have to offer.</p>
</div>
</article>
